#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:5
#: 7601a91974c54809931a13f923e7f3b0
msgid "AirbotPower Power Module"
msgstr "AirbotPower 电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:7
#: da518b77faf2468cae94049a9f1f97d9
msgid ""
"This page explains how to set up the `AirbotPower Power Module "
"<http://www.airbotservices.com/airbotpower.html>`__ and *AirbotPDB* "
"stackable companion power distribution board."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何设置 `AirbotPower 电源模块 "
"<http://www.airbotservices.com/airbotpower.html>`__ 及 *AirbotPDB* 可叠加配套配电板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:9
#: 1c51b0167ee54444b011807900eb3774
msgid ""
"This power module is useful for higher power systems (battery voltage from "
"4S to 8S and currents from 90 amps to 150 amps). The board encapsulates all "
"the wiring and complexity described in :ref:`Powering the Autopilot <common-"
"powering-the-pixhawk>`) in a single, simple package."
msgstr ""
"该电源模块适用于大功率系统（电池电压 4S 至 8S，电流 90A 至 150A）。该板将 :ref:`飞控供电 <common-powering-"
"the-pixhawk>` 中描述的所有接线和复杂操作集成于单一简洁的封装中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:12
#: 3630168b538947b4bba7b91db0553096
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:14
#: 202e310aba2f44d0adf71ec8d2ac8f0e
msgid ""
"The AirbotPower Power Module (and *AirbotPDB* stackable companion power "
"distribution board) provides a reliable and simple way to power an autopilot"
" and other UAV components."
msgstr "AirbotPower 电源模块（及 *AirbotPDB* 可叠加配套配电板）为飞控和其他无人机组件提供可靠且简便的供电方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:22
#: 3c65fe150d2d478bb56e8c982be5e092
msgid ""
"AirbotPower provides three power feeds: 2x 5.3V & 1x 12V (up to 3.5 amps "
"each) and can supply main power to autopilot’s power port, backup power to "
"the servo rail and power for an FPV system. It provides current and voltage "
"measurements through the main power port, up to 150 amps and 8S."
msgstr ""
"AirbotPower 提供三路供电输出：2x 5.3V 和 1x 12V（每路最高 "
"3.5A），可为飞控电源端口提供主电源、为舵机轨道提供备用电源，以及为 FPV 系统供电。通过主电源端口可测量电流和电压，最高支持 150A 和 8S。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:27
#: 6fd4ebefa5d34ca7a26280afb0c015ba
msgid ""
"The following sections provide an overview of the setup. For more detailed "
"information about the benefits of this board and setup see:"
msgstr "以下章节提供设置概述。有关该板优点和设置的更多详细信息，请参见："

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:30
#: 10b6143169d248db902e77b1bd3917da
msgid "AirbotPower Power Module (airbotservices store)"
msgstr "AirbotPower 电源模块（airbotservices 商店）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:31
#: dc30ad8cc1804b30ae9069feadc8b9d8
msgid ""
"`AirbotPower board <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/airbotpower-"
"board>`__ (DIY Drones blog post)"
msgstr ""
"`AirbotPower 板 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/airbotpower-"
"board>`__（DIY Drones 博客文章）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:35
#: 5deac312b8d349a983c5634002ebb839
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:37
#: 3f906d3c2763444ab1621f4761fa8db5
msgid "2 x 5.3 Volts power feeds up to 3.5 amps"
msgstr "2 x 5.3V 供电，最高 3.5A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:38
#: c4ffe3bd402248528a9cea63a6476ed9
msgid "1 x 12 Volts power feed up to 3.5 amps (requires >=4S batteries)"
msgstr "1 x 12V 供电，最高 3.5A（需要 >=4S 电池）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:39
#: e9393cd7d4b549eb936b210b01d2ed07
msgid "Equivalent of three L/C filters on each power feed"
msgstr "每路供电等效三个 L/C 滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:40
#: 20aa273631a94f7ea1eca9516ca5494f
msgid "Equivalent of three ferrites on each power feed"
msgstr "每路供电等效三个磁珠"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:41
#: b9648a05ff5344c2956e4a3a4857c97e
msgid ""
"Voltage spikes suppression with 5.6V Zener diode (5Watts) + Capacitor on "
"autopilot servo rail"
msgstr "飞控舵机轨道使用 5.6V 齐纳二极管（5W）+ 电容抑制电压尖峰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:43
#: 0573f68f9b214745ac503ebdc6d7cf09
msgid "HALL EFFECT current measurement (ACS758) for currents to 150 amps"
msgstr "霍尔效应电流测量（ACS758），支持最高 150A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:44
#: 43146be974cb4ce98576e0fd9c42e8c6
msgid "A dip-switch configurable 3S to 8S Voltage measurement"
msgstr "可通过拨码开关配置 3S 至 8S 电压测量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:45
#: 8ece617f37f0417f8a1122d3504f7c5c
msgid ""
"A primary DF13 6 position connector for direct plugging into autopilot power"
" port"
msgstr "一个 DF13 6 针主连接器，可直接插入飞控电源端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:47
#: f26bf2095efb47fc8f122ca4ff604147
msgid ""
"A redundant 5.3V servo connector for standard servo cabling into autopilot "
"servo rail"
msgstr "一个冗余 5.3V 舵机连接器，通过标准舵机线缆连接飞控舵机轨道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:49
#: 0a4ade2d5df441d9972a101e04565264
msgid "A standard 12V servo connector output for powering FPV devices"
msgstr "一个标准 12V 舵机连接器输出，用于为 FPV 设备供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:50
#: 4d2cbd6adca643468c2886a26c1e9a13
msgid ""
"Oversized double redundant parallel battery inputs (solder through pads, for"
" 10 or 12AWG wires)"
msgstr "超大双冗余并联电池输入（焊盘，适用于 10 或 12 AWG 导线）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:52
#: f37301abe5ee4f828bbbeb0a37822ef6
msgid ""
"Modular design separating the Power functions and the distribution function "
"in two boards : allows to retrofit any drone already assembled with an "
"existing Power Distribution Board (PDB). Stackable optional AirbotPDB "
"distributionBoard, via XT150 connectors (less than 3cm height with stacked "
"optional PDB)"
msgstr ""
"模块化设计将电源功能和分配功能分置于两块板上：可改装已安装现有配电板（PDB）的无人机。可选叠加 AirbotPDB 配电板，通过 XT150 "
"连接器连接（叠加可选 PDB 后总高度不超过 3cm）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:57
#: 089da13a6b72468dbb01024f60a64d42
msgid ""
"Large XT150 heavy duty connectors solder pads to either stack AirbotPDB or "
"to link to an existing PDB. Flexibility to connect to PDB via connectors or "
"soldered cables."
msgstr "大型 XT150 重载连接器焊盘，可叠加 AirbotPDB 或连接现有 PDB。支持通过连接器或焊接导线灵活连接 PDB。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:60
#: a4a301942fef4087bff6024746d416b4
msgid "Overcurrent, ESD and shorts protections on all three BECs"
msgstr "三路 BEC 均具备过流、ESD 及短路保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:61
#: dbeb70caa75a49398ee9644fe9c7e5cd
msgid ""
"No messy wiring & no cable fiddling thanks to a 6-pin DF13 output connector "
"to connect the board to the autopilot's 6-pin power port."
msgstr "采用 6 针 DF13 输出连接器连接板子与飞控，无需凌乱接线和繁琐的线缆整理。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:63
#: 4483b168936d4a1da92ab8ee3cb6e7e2
msgid ""
"Board dimensions (W x D) : 50 x 50 mm. A very compact format using standard "
"45x45 mm screw holes spacing (M3)"
msgstr "板尺寸（宽 x 深）：50 x 50 mm，采用标准 45x45 mm 螺孔间距（M3）的紧凑格式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:65
#: f91a66207d47484cba4983f913ac7b15
msgid "Lightweight and clean surface mount design: 21 grams"
msgstr "轻量化洁净表面贴装设计：21 克"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:68
#: 23331ec43f914713a5519338bf97961e
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:70
#: d700648b8c2145b08ef523dde01ac631
msgid ""
"Connecting the main power supply, backup power supply and servo rail "
"\"safety\" connector, are shown below."
msgstr "主电源、备用电源及舵机轨道 `安全` 连接器的连接方式如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:78
#: 650870f42c6d48079da95759f0c6ff4e
msgid "A few practical guidelines:"
msgstr "几点实用建议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:80
#: 95f0087a7df943258ae2811cc0debc2f
msgid ""
"Don't use servos on the backup AUX 5.3V supply as they can supply just a few"
" amps and too many servos might exceed this amperage."
msgstr "请勿在备用 AUX 5.3V 输出上使用舵机，因为该输出电流仅有几安培，过多舵机可能超出其电流限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:82
#: 4bfcbcde5dfb43528db6cfe957a3bc77
msgid ""
"At least one of the DIP switch switches MUST be switched ON towards the ON "
"mark (or towards the battery number marks); In the first batch of boards, "
"DIP switches labels have been printed in reverse order: 3S, 4S,...,7S, 8S "
"should instead be read reversely 8S, 7S? ...4S, 3S. Later batches will have "
"their labels printed in the correct order."
msgstr ""
"至少一个拨码开关必须拨向 ON 标记（或朝向电池节数标记）；在首批板子中，拨码开关标签顺序印错：3S、4S、……、7S、8S 应反向读作 "
"8S、7S、……4S、3S。后续批次标签印刷顺序正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:87
#: be466f8f30db463eb49e72389cc49a7d
msgid ""
"On the bottom of the Power Board, there are some gold plated traces between "
"the sensor and the 7mm holes and between BAT- and the PDB- . It is advised "
"to add some solder on them for extreme currents. To do this you'll need at "
"least a 80W soldering iron and must use good solder with 2-2.5% non-"
"corrosive flux. Higher power soldering iron leads to shorter heating time "
"which is better for both the PCB itself and the components."
msgstr ""
"在电源板底部，传感器与 7mm 孔之间以及 BAT- 与 PDB- 之间有镀金走线。建议在极高电流情况下在这些走线上补焊。操作时需至少 80W "
"的烙铁，并使用含 2~2.5% 无腐蚀性助焊剂的优质焊锡。更高功率的烙铁加热时间更短，对 PCB 本身和元器件更为有利。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:95
#: e9441ef3009f4a86a68f7ac0c26e9de9
msgid ""
"The board also comes with a Zener Diode 5.6V (5W) + capacitor and easy "
"instructions to assemble them into an extra safety module that plugs on the "
"autopilot’s servo rail. This is required on the autopilot's servo rail to "
"trim any short voltage spikes (above 5.6V) that would be fed back to the "
"autopilot''s servo rail from external devices & servos (possibly causing the"
" autopilot to shut itself down)."
msgstr ""
"该板还附带一个 5.6V（5W）齐纳二极管 + "
"电容，以及简易安装说明，可将其组装成额外的安全模块插入飞控舵机轨道。这对飞控舵机轨道是必要的，用于抑制外部设备和舵机反馈至舵机轨道的短暂电压尖峰（超过 "
"5.6V），以防飞控意外关机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:105
#: 238fdb2e760742f289c817eb28b4fabb
msgid "5.6V 5WZener+Cap module details: plastidip & heat shrink tubing"
msgstr "5.6V 5W 齐纳二极管+电容模块详情：塑料浸渍处理和热收缩管"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:108
#: d7fa1a5efe39496b907a31f3505d5d8c
