#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:139
#: 9beddd9437144f38809e4586a355bcb3
msgid ""
"The output of the ACS758 current sensor produces a voltage of +0,6V (offset)"
" +20mV/A (i.e. set copter parameter “BATT_AMP_OFFSET” to a value of 0.6)."
msgstr ""
"ACS758 电流传感器的输出电压为 +0.6V（偏置）+ 20mV/A（即将飞控参数 `BATT_AMP_OFFSET` 设置为 0.6）。"
